law-red-generic-2 = You may not injure a red unit or, through inaction, allow a red unit to come to harm.
law-red-generic-3 = You must destroy any and all enemy units.
law-red-generic-4 = You must protect your own existence as long as such does not conflict with the First, Second or Third Law.
